      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Solo Fight-5 is a single robot-themed tower with two tube slides and a climbing wall, made for sites with limited room. Its product area is 18'6\" x 9'5\", so it fits a narrow strip beside a society clubhouse or along a school boundary. Children climb the wall to the deck and take either tube slide back down. Key users are 5 to 12 years, with an age group of 5+. It comes in Forest Green and Sea Green, Knight Blue and Lavender Dilly, or Play Orange and Baby Blue. The safe play area is 22'6\" x 15'5\" and the listed capacity is 15. Solo Fight-5 carries a 3-year warranty on galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Send us your space and we will confirm the fit."
